    },
    {
      "id": "2121812583640383699",
      "text": "Outstanding stretch of hockey from the Devils. I know it's only 21 games, but the resilience, compete and maturity from this group has been really encouraging. Reset, recharge and do it again over the next 21! #NJDevils",
      "url": "https://x.com/brycesalvador/status/2121812583640383699",
      "published": "2026-11-15T03:48:35+00:00",
      "likes": 96,
      "author": "Bryce Salvador",
      "handle": "brycesalvador",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1750329506613616640/dzRljNgL_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "7-0-0 in the Black and Red. 3-0-0 when well rested. https://t.co/OpQDdZcUU7",
      "quoted_author": "New Jersey Devils",
      "quoted_handle": "NJDevils"
    },
    {
      "id": "2121811342826918315",
      "text": "Hischier on the significance of the #NJDevils getting scoring all through the lineup: \"I think that's what very good teams do. They get scoring from every line, and we have the depth this year, and we've been saying it since day one. Every line can score, every line can play",
      "url": "https://x.com/amandacstein/status/2121811342826918315",
